WEBVTT

00:04:59.292 --> 00:05:01.851
For this song, I'd like us all
to take a minute

00:05:01.875 --> 00:05:04.476
and think about immigrant communities,

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.684
and especially refugee
immigrant communities,

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:10.434
and the daily struggle
they have to endure,

00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:12.434
building a life with dignity and meaning

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:15.559
away from everything
they have loved and known.

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:18.226
If you feel any empathy for this idea,

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.559
I ask to see your fist
up in the air with me.

00:05:20.583 --> 00:05:22.268
(Music)

00:05:22.292 --> 00:05:23.542
"Million voice."

00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:27.726
The mandem make some noise

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.059
With a million, million voice